meone on a message board that I would rather go to Don Corleone for help than to the police. She immediately started berating me for having &amp;quot;romanticized notions&amp;quot; about the mafia - to which I responded, &amp;quot;I didn&amp;#39;t say I would *want* to go to the mafia, I said I would *rather*. What&amp;#39;s that tell you about my opinion of cops?&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/1683051219486488545'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/1683051219486488545'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html?showComment=1274709678302#c1683051219486488545' title=''/><author><name>Rose Gonella</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-65824423487768490' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/65824423487768490' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-948847314"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 24, 2010 at 8:01 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1148804294942244914</id><published>2010-05-22T11:19:21.469-06:00</published><updated>2010-05-22T11:19:21.469-06:00</updated><title type='text'>FYI regarding steroid-enhanced cops:&#xa;&#xa;http://freed...</title><content type='html'>FYI regarding steroid-enhanced cops:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/09/state-on-steroids.html&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Incidentally, Joseph Weekley, according to his bio, is just a little taller than my wife Korrin, who is the proverbial five-foot-two, eyes-of-blue.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/1148804294942244914'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/1148804294942244914'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html?showComment=1274548761469#c1148804294942244914' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_KgBT8kIRgBo/S9pLFt945PI/AAAAAAAAGnM/ZkLMUakTnDM/S220/dad.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-65824423487768490' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/65824423487768490' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 22, 2010 at 11:19 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2717332322579704476</id><published>2010-05-22T11:01:20.581-06:00</published><updated>2010-05-22T11:01:20.581-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Isaac,&#xa;&#xa;Cops and steroids have gone together like ...</title><content type='html'>Isaac,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Cops and steroids have gone together like peanut butter and chocolate for a long time now. Men&amp;#39;s Health magazine published an article detailing the problem:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://tinyurl.com/36vs7o5&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Dale</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/2717332322579704476'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/2717332322579704476'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html?showComment=1274547680581#c2717332322579704476' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-65824423487768490' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/65824423487768490' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1874383567"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 22, 2010 at 11:01 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6940964874111246237</id><published>2010-05-22T08:50:26.549-06:00</published><updated>2010-05-22T08:50:26.549-06:00</updated><title type='text'>There&amp;#39;s an article by Eric Peters called &amp;quot...</title><content type='html'>There&amp;#39;s an article by Eric Peters called &amp;quot;How to Survive a traffic stop&amp;quot;, or similar sounding, on vdare.com at the moment that deals with this issue. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Its only going to get worse -- you all know it.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/6940964874111246237'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/6940964874111246237'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html?showComment=1274539826549#c6940964874111246237' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-65824423487768490' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/65824423487768490' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-973336606"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 22, 2010 at 8:50 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-909591796418772699</id><published>2010-05-22T08:46:08.650-06:00</published><updated>2010-05-22T08:46:08.650-06:00</updated><title type='text'>This episode of &amp;quot;Cops Gone Wild&amp;quot; brought...</title><content type='html'>This episode of &amp;quot;Cops Gone Wild&amp;quot; brought to you and made possible by the American TV viewing public, the most bloodthirsty and apathetic bunch to ever darken the Earths doorstep.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/909591796418772699'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/909591796418772699'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html?showComment=1274539568650#c909591796418772699' title=''/><author><name>Saladin</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09930510353343780782</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='27' src='http://bp1.blogger.com/_3nm82BZKt8w/SGV-ZNce_fI/AAAAAAAAABE/ea2m8hZnrRw/S220/Help+child.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-65824423487768490' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/65824423487768490' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-376846434"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 22, 2010 at 8:46 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4798584391963927852</id><published>2010-05-21T23:10:20.759-06:00</published><updated>2010-05-21T23:10:20.759-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Congress makes a big grandstanding to-do about ste...</title><content type='html'>Congress makes a big grandstanding to-do about steroids in sports, but is anyone checking to see who else might be juicing themselves up? Like maybe cops? Every time you see a cop with a kid in a headlock down at the skate park, think roid rage.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/4798584391963927852'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/4798584391963927852'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html?showComment=1274505020759#c4798584391963927852' title=''/><author><name>Isaac</name><uri>http://thestanfielddoctrine.blogspot.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-65824423487768490' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/65824423487768490' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1044830925"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 21, 2010 at 11:10 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8376952664667727592</id><published>2010-05-21T16:07:35.155-06:00</published><updated>2010-05-21T16:07:35.155-06:00</updated><title type='text'>After reading this, an idea occurred: Would it be ...</title><content type='html'>After reading this, an idea occurred: Would it be worth starting a non-profit organization dedicated to raising money to move the few honest, hard-working, decent, liberty-loving, law-abiding citizens left in Detroit out of that dysfunctional dsytopia and moving them to some other part of the country (or the planet, for that matter) that offers at least some measure of decency, peace, and hope?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;After doing this, we could then build a concrete and concertina wire wall around what&amp;#39;s left of the city, surround it with landmines, and helidrop all of the Wall Street banksters, &amp;quot;law enforcement&amp;quot; types, and politicos inside, leaving them to fend for themselves at the tender mercies of the remaining criminal element.   The copscum ought to consider this a great &amp;quot;hunting&amp;quot; opportunity, so they shouldn&amp;#39;t mind the relocation.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Hey, there&amp;#39;s no law against daydreaming and fantasizing - yet.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/8376952664667727592'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/8376952664667727592'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html?showComment=1274479655155#c8376952664667727592' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-65824423487768490' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/65824423487768490' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 21, 2010 at 4:07 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6768868751770219314</id><published>2010-05-21T14:33:36.110-06:00</published><updated>2010-05-21T14:33:36.110-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Liberal blogs are covering this story pretty heavi...</title><content type='html'>Liberal blogs are covering this story pretty heavily.  Of course, none of them realize that stories like this disprove their idea of government as a force for good in the world.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/6768868751770219314'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/6768868751770219314'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html?showComment=1274474016110#c6768868751770219314' title=''/><author><name>TAS</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00260719592299142917</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd: