/www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/65824423487768490' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1063490373"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 21, 2010 at 1:51 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1132000615183005318</id><published>2010-05-21T11:08:14.884-06:00</published><updated>2010-05-21T11:08:14.884-06:00</updated><title type='text'>jdogg...&#xa;&#xa;I was thinking the exact same thing and ...</title><content type='html'>jdogg...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I was thinking the exact same thing and had half way wondered if &amp;quot;The Running Man&amp;quot; wouldn&amp;#39;t be premiering this fall say on CBS?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/1132000615183005318'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/1132000615183005318'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html?showComment=1274461694884#c1132000615183005318' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-65824423487768490' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/65824423487768490' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-219243384"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 21, 2010 at 11:08 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5582675012463550752</id><published>2010-05-21T09:25:17.981-06:00</published><updated>2010-05-21T09:25:17.981-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Why not just have &amp;quot;The Running Man&amp;quot; TV s...</title><content type='html'>Why not just have &amp;quot;The Running Man&amp;quot; TV show for real and be done with it?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/5582675012463550752'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/5582675012463550752'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html?showComment=1274455517981#c5582675012463550752' title=''/><author><name>jdogg</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-65824423487768490' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/65824423487768490' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1672373322"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 21, 2010 at 9:25 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1425709953571888002</id><published>2010-05-21T06:43:59.974-06:00</published><updated>2010-05-21T06:43:59.974-06:00</updated><title type='text'>1) An apt quotation from an author that Mr. Grigg ...</title><content type='html'>1) An apt quotation from an author that Mr. Grigg has referenced before; very much applicable to our present time and place.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;quot;A great disaster had befallen Russia: Men have forgotten God; that&amp;#39;s why all this has happened.&amp;quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;— Aleksandr I. Solzhenitsyn&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;2) Burned by the grenade AND shot?  Am I the only one who is suspicious of this incredible coincidence?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;3) Never heard of Zoe Saldana.&lt;br /&gt;Am I that far behind in pop culture?  Yes, apparently!&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;4) Your appeal is duly noted Will, and I will be glad to help.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/1425709953571888002'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/1425709953571888002'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html?showComment=1274445839974#c1425709953571888002' title=''/><author><name>Daniel Hewitt</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-65824423487768490' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/65824423487768490' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1255395480"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 21, 2010 at 6:43 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5600136409620643179</id><published>2010-05-20T23:10:44.699-06:00</published><updated>2010-05-20T23:10:44.699-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;the mafia has greater morals than the gov&amp;#3...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;the mafia has greater morals than the gov&amp;#39;t.&amp;quot;,... It does appear that way.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I came across a news blurb and thought you might find it interesting, although, it&amp;#39;s nothing like the Detroit SWAT team:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;After an argument, the Angels pushed the victim against a wall, punched him in the face and broke his arm,... Then they shoved the victim to the ground, and one held the victim in a headlock while another put handcuffs on him.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The suspects broke the victim’s arm in three places,... &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;“They had plenty of time to call the police and didn’t,”&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;[The Guardian Angel]... does not apologize for his actions.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;...Like cops, we have the right to defend ourselves in any way that we can.”&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://qctimes.com/news/local/article_6f649294-6302-11df-a757-001cc4c03286.html</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/5600136409620643179'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/5600136409620643179'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html?showComment=1274418644699#c5600136409620643179' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-65824423487768490' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/65824423487768490' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-201522803"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 20, 2010 at 11:10 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7488549046845044346</id><published>2010-05-20T21:55:42.090-06:00</published><updated>2010-05-20T21:55:42.090-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The details are still dribbling out, but read toda...</title><content type='html'>The details are still dribbling out, but read today that the film shows the officer firing into the building before entry and before the flash-bang was sent through the window.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Shoot first - cover up later seems to be the motto of LEO&amp;#39;s today.  That is until a camera or voice recording catches them.  At least in my youth, Pigs (as the were called then) were much more respectable than the gov&amp;#39;t thug of today.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And you allude to something I&amp;#39;ve said for years, the mafia has greater morals than the gov&amp;#39;t.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In Male Fide&lt;br /&gt;Sic Semper Tyrannis</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/7488549046845044346'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65824423487768490/comments/default/7488549046845044346'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html?showComment=1274414142090#c7488549046845044346' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/05/kill-them-all-for-god-will-know-his-own.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-65824423487768490' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/65824423487768490' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1803118061"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 20, 2010 at 9:55 PM"/></entry></feed>